            "review_text": "Zacharias Z.\nCopenhagen, Denmark45 contributions\n0\nSweet restaurant with a great view on top!\nJul 2017 • Couples\nWe came here at lunch for some traditional bánh mì. They have around 10-12 variations. Tasted great and you even get a banana on the side for dessert :)\nThe price was a bit higher than at the food stalls, but the staff was smily and friendly. Especially when we found a big piece of plastic in our food. They replaced it immediatedly with a new baguette and was very sorry about it. Would absolutely recommend this place - and do go to the balcony upstairs for an overview of the busy life of Hanoi.\nRead more\nWritten July 10, 2017",
